# Vouched contributors for this repo. See https://github.com/mitchellh/vouch
#
# Bots and anyone with write access to this repo are always allowed. Everyone
# else, including org members with read access, needs an entry here before
# their pull requests stay open. CONTRIBUTING.md explains how to get one.
#
# Maintainers manage this file by commenting on an issue or pull request:
#   !vouch                  vouch for the author
#   !vouch @user            vouch for someone else
#   !denounce [reason]      block the author; their issues and pull requests are closed
#   !unvouch @user          remove someone from the list
#
# Syntax:
#   - One handle per line (without @), sorted alphabetically.
#   - Denounce with a minus prefix: -username reason.
